@title: form_countries
@context: Every country and both plans reach the answer.
@tags: form
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the sign-up form
    NAVIGATE to 'Signup'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Signup'

STEP 2: Name and terms
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Kent Beck'
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    VERIFY that 'Create account' is enabled

STEP 3: Ukraine
    SELECT 'Ukraine' from the 'Country' dropdown
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Kent Beck! Plan: free, country: Ukraine, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 4: Japan
    SELECT 'Japan' from the 'Country' dropdown
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Kent Beck! Plan: free, country: Japan, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 5: Canada
    SELECT 'Canada' from the 'Country' dropdown
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Kent Beck! Plan: free, country: Canada, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 6: Pro, without the newsletter
    CLICK the radio button for 'Pro'
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'Newsletter'
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Kent Beck! Plan: pro, country: Canada, newsletter: no' is present

STEP 7: Back to free
    CLICK the radio button for 'Free'
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Kent Beck! Plan: free, country: Canada, newsletter: no' is present

DONE.
